docs/REPOSITORY_QUALITY.md:40:The script adds metadata/topics/labels and enables private vulnerability reporting, dependency alerts/security updates, secret scanning and push protection where available. It preserves existing unrelated topics/labels, protections, visibility, collaborators, and release state. It reads back metadata, topics, each configured label, private reporting, Dependabot alerts/security updates, and secret-scanning settings. Missing, paused, or mismatched settings produce an unresolved result and nonzero exit status. Effective scanning coverage still needs review. Existing matching label descriptions/colors are standardized. Do not put tokens in shell arguments or tracked files.
