docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-04-nexus-tui-phase3a-interaction-core.md:2976:`nexus-tui --live --sidecar PATH --node BIN -- ARGS` runs `BIN PATH ARGS`. Create `cli/test/helpers/sidecar_recorder.mjs`, a transparent shim launched as that `PATH`. It spawns `process.execPath` with `[process.env.NEXUS_RECORD_SIDECAR, ...process.argv.slice(2)]` and `stdio: ["pipe", "pipe", "inherit"]`. Every stdin chunk is appended to `process.env.NEXUS_RECORD_COMMANDS` and forwarded to the child; stdin end ends the child's stdin. Every child stdout chunk is appended to `process.env.NEXUS_RECORD_EVENTS` and forwarded to `process.stdout`. It forwards SIGTERM, SIGINT and SIGHUP to the child and exits with the child's exit code (1 if it was killed by a signal). Use synchronous appends so the logs are complete when the process exits. The shim never parses, filters or rewrites bytes.
